<title>QATAR: TENNIS-DAVIS CUP ASIA/OCEANIA ZONE THREE RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-DAVIS CUP ASIA/OCEANIA ZONE THREE RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>DOHA 1997-03-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Davis Cup tennis</p>
<p>Asia/Oceania zone three results on Saturday:</p>
<p>Pacific Oceania lead Kuwait 2-1</p>
<p>Results (Pacific Oceania names first):</p>
<p>Motuliki Kailahi beat Mohammad Rashid 6-3 6-2</p>
<p>Lency Tenai lost to Adel al-Shatti 6-2 2-6 0-6</p>
<p>Kailahi/Tenai beat al-Shatti/Khalid al-Gharabally 1-6  6-2 6-2</p>
<p>Qatar lead Kazakhstan 2-1</p>
<p>Results (Qatar names first): Nasser Ghanim al-Khelaifi lost</p>
<p>to Alexei Kedryuk 2-6 2-6</p>
<p>Sultan Khalfan al-Alawi beat Igor Chaldounov 6-0 6-3</p>
<p>Al-Alawi/Cesarito Diong beat Chaldounov/Kedryuk 6-2 6-4</p>
<p>Malaysia lead Bahrain 2-1</p>
<p>Results (Malaysia names first):</p>
<p>Vasuthevan Ortchuan lost to Esam Jaafer Ali Abdulaal 5-7 3-6</p>
<p>Ramaiah Ramachandran beat Abdul Rahman Shehab 6-1 6-0</p>
<p>Jamal Mulyadi/Ramachandran beat Shehab Rashid Ahmed/</p>
<p>Nader-Jaafer Ali Abdul Aal 6-0 6-2</p>
<p>Sri Lanka lead Bangladesh 2-1</p>
<p>Results (Sri Lanka names first):</p>
<p>Samantha Rohan DeSilva beat Dilip Passia 5-7 6-4 6-1</p>
<p>Jayendra Wijeyasekera lost to Shovon Jamaly 6-2 4-6 2-6</p>
<p>DeSilva/Wijeyasekera beat Jamaly/Passia 3-6 6-4 6-4</p>
</text>
